{
 "info": {
  "name": "Decidiq urgent decision procedure",
  "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
  "description": "API contract of the urgent decision procedure (openspec/changes/urgent-decision-procedure): only the meeting's chair (or a role the body's urgency policy allows) declares urgency (401 without a session, 403 otherwise, 422 without a reason, 409 twice); the declaration stores the urgency fields, keeps the lifecycle, appends a ratifying stage for the policy's body and puts it on that body's next regular meeting; the urgency fields cannot be written through the object API, and an edit that leaves them out keeps them; the expedited written round keeps to the policy's hour bounds (422 outside 4 to 72, 422 on a decision that is not urgent, 201 with the deadline 24 hours out). Self-contained: setup seeds the objects through the OpenRegister object API as the admin and teardown deletes them."
 },
